{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Dream Prison&quot; is a 3D horror escape game similar to Exit 8. Find the anomalous rooms and escape the cult church.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Game Background] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a church, and a voice guides you to the room on the left. The path out of the church is unusually winding, but not without clues. The correct path is guarded by dream figures; find the anomalies to discover the escape route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Game Features] </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully designed anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">terrifying atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Development Team]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developer: Budai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BGM: \u201cMusic Egg\u201d Takai, Music Atelier Amacha</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Model: Bought from fab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound Effects: Found on pixabay</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617820?t=1744909437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617820?t=1744909437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617820/3506df2a1c17d48a73c3d83a7cb6b3485146c16a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744909437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617820/3506df2a1c17d48a73c3d83a7cb6b3485146c16a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744909437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Blood, Jump Scares are shown in the game"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Dream Prison&quot; is a 3D horror escape game similar to Exit 8. Find the anomalous rooms and escape the cult church.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[Game Bac